  lines:
  - Do you know what stop I should get off at?
  - Zdu, Idrzc rc rknabz
  - Do you know which bus I should get on?
  - Wa hbdy qdsx ghhn lqx kt ntisbf oh zdos dpt qa lhq abn!
  - "I can\u2019t understand you."
  - Gkrb!!!! Qh qa esq 83, Brgbt pq gkoilex sm imnas mg qhumnw
  - (You stare in confusion)
  - (He scoffs, pointing to the road)
  - (Was he wearing that hoodie before?)
  - '(Even so.. something tells you to walk to that restaurant.. It stirs feelings
    in you that you were sure had been forgotten.) '
  names:
  - You
  - ???
